1
00:00:11,696 --> 00:00:14,368
Hey, Grandpa. How are you?

2
00:00:14,720 --> 00:00:16,848
How’s the weather in Australia?

3
00:00:17,136 --> 00:00:21,344
Hi, Lucy. It’s raining cats and dogs.

4
00:00:22,240 --> 00:00:25,296
Oh! And now there’s lightning!

5
00:00:25,488 --> 00:00:28,096
Oh no, don’t go outside!

6
00:00:28,800 --> 00:00:33,760
Don’t worry. I’m staying in! What’s the weather like back home?

7
00:00:34,528 --> 00:00:36,000
What are you doing now?

8
00:00:36,672 --> 00:00:38,992
I’m watering flowers in the garden.

9
00:00:39,280 --> 00:00:41,376
It’s sunny and warm here!

10
00:00:41,856 --> 00:00:45,616
Lucky you! Well, enjoy your day!

11
00:00:45,936 --> 00:00:46,896
You too!

12
00:00:47,168 --> 00:00:50,080
I’m always happy, rain or shine!

